      "id": "claim_7f9ee33d42b74fec93893f659cb039d8",
      "statement": "The Docker image installs the package with the EXTRAS build argument (default chatbot), asserts at build time that the installed dtcc-core commit equals the pyproject pin, sets DTCC_AGENT_ARTIFACTS_DIR=/data/artifacts, runs as a non-root user, and by default starts the chatbot on port 8050.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:4f41931ea595251be93edc888c75437e84004809d3abf1c7338a2656431ad74f"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_88c5a646d86b470c94872a17b7a1ed8a",
      "statement": "docker-compose runs an MCP service on unpublished 127.0.0.1:8051 that publishes the chatbot's 8050, has a 5g memory limit by default and restarts unless stopped, and a chatbot service sharing its network namespace and /data volume, started after the MCP service is healthy; only the MCP service mounts /shared/results.",
